        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3b964eaf-fde2-41d9-9211-af8e16f25a56).Image",
        "Description": "Listen pal, we got a little pest problem we need gone. Ya see Sister Lei thought she could just borrow loads of cash from the mob and not pay it back, running to be Hush&apos;s assistant both for her own reasons and for the protection his guards provide. Now I want a nice clean whack, just her and a bullet to the head. Oh and make it snappy would ya? The train doesn&apos;t wait for anyone ya know.",
